{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a senior dies, almost everything\nhanded to the people left behind arrives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5220,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whole. The government does not get a share\nof it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9200,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody tells the family that, so they wait\nfor a bill that never comes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14220,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one thing does carry a bill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16660,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It arrives quietly, with a clock already\nrunning, and the people who inherit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21420,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it usually find out years late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24560,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seven things pass on. Six are out of\nreach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27720,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is not. All seven are below, and the\none that costs money comes last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33720,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before any of it, one line, because the\ntwo get mixed up everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38840,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is about tax on income. It is not\nabout the separate tax a very large"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43900,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "estate can face, which almost no household\nin this country ever meets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48680,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number one. The money itself is not\nincome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52020,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing is owed on what was left to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54580,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the one people get wrong before\nanything else happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57740,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A son gets forty thousand dollars from his\nmother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61520,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He spends the first week asking how much\nof it he has to hand back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65320,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is none of it. Not a dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68580,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Property handed over as a gift, as a\nbequest, or by inheritance is not counted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73760,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75020,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the rule as written. So the money\nclears and the amount is yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79980,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no form for it. There is no line\non a return where you report it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84140,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People go looking for that line, cannot\nfind it, and assume they have missed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88700,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something. They have not. It is not there\nbecause there is nothing to report."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93580,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing to do is nothing at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95760,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spend a week being certain of that instead\nof worried about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99580,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number two. A policy pays the full sum to\nwhoever is named on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104220,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a life policy pays because somebody\nhas died, that payment is not treated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109640,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as income. Say the policy is a hundred and\nfifty thousand dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115021,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A hundred and fifty thousand reaches the\nperson named."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118060,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a hundred and twenty. Not a hundred\nand thirty five after something is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121900,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taken out. The whole of it. And this does\nnot depend on who that person is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127420,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A wife. A son. A daughter. A neighbor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131100,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A church. The rule does not change based\non the relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134840,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if there is a policy in the house, the\nuseful thing is to know whose name"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139980,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is written on it, and whether that name is\nstill correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143460,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A name written down thirty years ago is\nthe name that gets paid, whatever has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147620,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happened since."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149280,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number three. A veteran benefit keeps its\nshield after death."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153760,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No tax, no collector."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156180,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money paid for a veteran's service carries\nthree protections at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160240,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It cannot be signed over to somebody else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162280,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is out of reach of people chasing a\ndebt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165260,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is not taxed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167240,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those protections do not fall away when\nthe veteran dies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170480,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They stay attached to the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172600,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This matters more than people expect,\nbecause debt is the thing families fear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176680,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most in that first month. A collector\ntelephones, speaks with confidence, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the widow assumes the money in question is\nfair game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184740,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the money came from a veteran's\nservice, it was never fair game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188340,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say that out loud on the telephone and the\nconversation usually ends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193220,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number four. The house is valued from the\nday they died, not the day it was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197900,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bought. This one quietly saves families\nthe most, and almost nobody understands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202820,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it until a house is sold. A father buys a\nhouse in nineteen seventy eight for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208000,
    "dDurationMs": 4037,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thirty thousand dollars. He dies, and it\nis worth four hundred thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212780,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The daughter inherits it and sells it the\nfollowing year for four hundred and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216448,
    "dDurationMs": 4152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five thousand. Her gain is not three\nhundred and seventy five thousand dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221020,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is five thousand. The clock resets on\nthe day of the death."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225240,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything the house gained while he was\nalive goes untouched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228780,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only what it moves afterwards is counted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231460,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People sell fast, frightened, certain a\nhuge bill is coming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235720,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some sell cheap to get it over with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237880,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bill they are frightened of does not\nexist, and the fear costs them real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241780,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money. So before anybody signs anything,\nfind out what the house was worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246320,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the day of the death. That single\nfigure is the one that decides everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250540,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that follows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number five. What the money earns after it\nreaches you is counted, and people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256460,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "miss this. Here the direction changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259740,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything so far arrives clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261940,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens next does not. The\ninheritance is not income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265580,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once it is yours and it starts\nearning, the earnings are income like any"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270200,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other. Forty thousand dollars sits in an\naccount and pays interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273960,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The interest is counted. Shares pay a\ndividend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277160,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The dividend is counted. An inherited\nhouse gets rented out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280780,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rent is counted. The money came in\nfree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283880,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What it produces from that day forward\ndoes not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286880,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where an honest family gets\ncaught, because nothing about it feels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290400,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a change. Same money, same account,\nsame house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294680,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the law draws a line on the day it\nbecame yours, and everything after that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298740,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "line is ordinary income. So keep the\npaperwork from that first year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303620,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not for the inheritance. For what it\nearned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306820,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number six. Take the policy in pieces\ninstead of one sum and part of it becomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311360,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taxable. The gentlest-looking choice here\nis the one with the trap in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316720,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An insurance company will often offer two\nways to pay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320060,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole amount now, or the same amount\nspread across years, which sounds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "safer to somebody who has never held that\nmuch money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Choose the whole amount and nothing is\nowed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331240,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Choose the payments spread out and the\ncompany holds the balance while it pays"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334620,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. That balance earns while it waits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337840,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The original sum stays untaxed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340340,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The earnings stacked on top are counted,\nyear after year, the whole time it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344600,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "runs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345600,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody at the company is required to\nexplain that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348360,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They offer two doors and both look safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351220,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If somebody is offering you a choice like\nthat, ask one question before you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355240,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "choose. Ask how much of each payment is\nthe policy and how much is interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360240,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have that number. They will give it\nto you if you ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364120,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number seven. One account arrives with a\nbill and a clock already running."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368820,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the one. A retirement account is\ndifferent from everything else on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372480,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this list, because the person who built it\nnever paid tax on the money going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376640,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in. That was the arrangement. Tax waits\nuntil it comes out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381080,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Death does not cancel the arrangement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383120,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It hands it to you. So money leaving an\ninherited retirement account counts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387700,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as income for whichever year you pull it\nout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390620,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the whole account at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392220,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The part you withdraw, in the year you\nwithdraw it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395320,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is a clock. If you are not the\nhusband or wife, the account generally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399440,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has to be empty by the end of the tenth\nyear after the death."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403160,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the part that catches people, and it\nis why this one sits at the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407020,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you also have to take something\nout every single year in between turns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410720,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on one thing you had no part in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412600,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It rests on the age of the person who\ndied, and whether the law had already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416400,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "made them start drawing it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418440,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they had not reached it, you can leave\nthe account alone and empty it by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422300,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year ten. If they had reached it, you are\nmeant to take something out every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426620,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year along the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428560,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Miss those years and there is a penalty\nwaiting, and most people who inherit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432860,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are never told the question exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435800,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A husband or wife has their own options\nand is treated differently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439440,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A child who inherits young gets more time,\nuntil twenty one, and then the ten"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444860,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "years begin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446500,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the question to ask, and ask it early,\nis this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450260,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How old was the person when they died, and\nhad they already started taking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454000,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money out? The answer decides whether your\nclock needs attention this year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458220,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or in nine years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460200,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the line that joins all seven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462700,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six of these arrive whole because the tax\nwas either already settled or never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466980,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owed. The seventh arrives with the tax\nstill unpaid, because that was the deal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471940,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the account was opened. That is all\nit comes down to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475480,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not fairness, not family. Only whether the\ntax had been settled yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480520,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me be straight about where this stops\nbeing useful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483420,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I cannot tell you about your own\nsituation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486320,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "States add their own rules on top, a few\ncharge something of their own on what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490080,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passes between people, and the paperwork\ndiffers everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493200,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If there is a retirement account involved,\nthat is the point to pay somebody"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497640,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for an hour of their time, because the\nclock is the part that costs money to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501600,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502820,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the seven, one more time. What was\nleft to you is not income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A policy pays its full face to the name on\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510700,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A veteran's money keeps its protection\nafter death."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513720,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A house is measured from the day of the\ndeath, not the day of the purchase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517860,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What any of it earns afterwards is\ncounted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520120,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spreading a policy over years adds\ninterest, and interest is counted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525180,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a retirement account comes with tax\nowing and a ten year clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529680,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of this is hidden. It is printed, it\nis free to read, and it has been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533640,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "settled for years. Families get it wrong\nbecause the month it matters is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538300,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worst month of their lives, and nobody\nsits them down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541620,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One last thing, because these calls come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544140,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody official telephones a grieving\nfamily about an inheritance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547840,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a voice offers to release money for a\nfee, or needs a card number to start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552580,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the process, that is somebody who read a\ndeath notice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556180,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hang up. And if a death in your family is\nstill being sorted out, do not ask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560820,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what anybody is getting. Ask one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563700,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a retirement account in it, and\nhas anyone looked at the clock?"
    } ]
  } ]
}
